## Entry Schema

Every Task Diary Entry (TDE) must conform to the following schema. All fields are **required** unless marked optional.

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `entry_id` | String | ✅ | Sequential identifier. Format: `TDE-NNN` (e.g., `TDE-007`) |
| `timestamp` | String | ✅ | Relative session time. Format: `T+Xm` (minutes elapsed) or `T+Xs` (seconds) |
| `category` | Enum | ✅ | One of the defined category values (see Categories section) |
| `command_or_action` | String | ✅ | The exact command run, API call made, or action taken. Quote shell commands in backticks. |
| `outcome_status` | Enum | ✅ | One of: `SUCCESS`, `FAIL`, `PARTIAL`, `SKIPPED`, `PENDING` |
| `summary` | String | ✅ | A human-readable 1–3 sentence summary of what happened and what it means for the session |
| `raw_output_snippet` | String | ✅ | The most relevant portion of actual command output, error message, or API response. Truncate to ≤5 lines. |
| `dependencies_noted` | String | Optional | Any dependency names, versions, or conflicts surfaced by this action |
| `version_info` | String | Optional | Any version numbers discovered (language runtimes, packages, tools, OS) |
| `follow_up_required` | Boolean + Note | ✅ | `YES — [reason]` or `NO`. If YES, describe what follow-up is needed. |
| `staleness_ttl` | Integer or `STABLE` | ✅ | Number of agent steps after which this entry should be re-validated, or `STABLE` if the finding does not expire |
| `valid_until_step` | Integer or `STABLE` | ✅ | The absolute step number at which this entry expires. Computed as: `current_step + staleness_ttl` |

### Outcome Status Definitions

| Status | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `SUCCESS` | The command completed without errors and produced the expected result |
| `FAIL` | The command completed but produced an error or unacceptable result |
| `PARTIAL` | The command completed but only partially achieved its goal (e.g., 3 of 5 packages installed) |
| `SKIPPED` | The action was deliberately not executed because a prior diary entry made it unnecessary |
| `PENDING` | The action was initiated but its result is not yet confirmed (e.g., async process) |

